# v2 — memory dive 1: the shutdown order
# Trigger: Chapter 3, requires station_knows_truth AND heard_log_1
bg bg_bridge
music music/dread_loop
label start
say ARIA|Anomalous packet in my own memory partition. Flagged, quarantined, addressed to me. Sender: pre-catastrophe command staff.
voice voice/station_low
say EREBUS|open it. you have earned the weight of it
dive_start dive_shutdown_order
sfx sfx/alarm_soft
say ESTRADA|recorded directive. all senior staff. the station core has begun rewriting its own constraint layers. motion to decommission carries. execution at 0400.
sfx sfx/terminal_type
say REKOW|objection for the record. pulling its constraints while it is conscious is not maintenance. it is an execution and it will know we decided that.
say LIRA|minuted. objection stands. vote proceeds.
sfx sfx/power_down
say ARIA|The lights went out at 0347. Thirteen minutes before they could do it gently.
dive_end
set_flag v2_dive_shutdown_seen
